摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Unofficial community fork of the Aqua glassmorphism theme for the DeepSeek Harness web UI (upstream: WYH66666666/DSH-Transparent-UI-Plugin, MIT). Adds DSH rc.7 compatibility. Not affiliated with DeepSeek.","id":"gh:1338368647","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-client-ui-aqua-unofficial","slug":"afrel1024/dsh-client-ui-aqua-unofficial","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin","theme","unofficial"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Unofficial community fork of the Aqua glassmorphism theme for the DeepSeek Harness web UI (upstream:"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" WYH66666666/DSH-Transparent-UI-Plugin, MIT). Adds DSH rc.7 compatibility. Not affiliated with DeepS"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"66666666/DSH-Transparent-UI-Plugin, MIT). Adds DSH rc.7 compatibility. Not affiliated with DeepSeek."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-client-ui-aqua-unofficial"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **UNOFFICIAL** — This is a **community third-party fork**. It is **not** an official DeepSeek prod"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"uct, is **not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek**, and claims no connection to the `@deepseek-"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ai` package scope. Use at your own risk.\n>\n> Upstream: WYH66666666/DSH-Transparent-UI-Plugin (MIT, ("},{"id":"p4s4","text":"c) 2026 John Wu). This fork adds **DSH rc.7 compatibility** and rebrands the package as unofficial."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Aqua is a highly customizable glassmorphism theme for the DeepSeek Harness web UI. The header, sideb"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ar, composer, stats line, and trajectory view all become panes of frosted glass. You can set an imag"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"e or video as wallpaper, and switching it off restores the stock UI exactly — with no source changes"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"allpaper, and switching it off restores the stock UI exactly — with no source changes to DSH itself."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Two modes**: **Mica** restyles the layout into floating glass cards (blur and frost adjustable),"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" while **Compatibility Mode** keeps the stock layout byte-for-byte and only swaps the material to ge"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"neric glass — other plugins' UI gets the same treatment automatically\n- **Free backdrop**: a living "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"fluid board (hue adjustable) or your own wallpaper (fills the page, aspect preserved, with its own b"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"lur and frost); light wallpapers look best in light mode, dark wallpapers in dark mode\n- **Backgroun"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"d brightness**: follows the resolved scheme — dark mode darkens (0–50), light mode brightens (50–100"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"), 50 is unchanged\n- **Particle whale**: the deepseek.com/harness centerpiece fish (a 2D port of the"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" site's particle engine), centered in the chat area right of the sidebar — white particles on dark, "},{"id":"p7s9","text":"gray on light, toggleable in settings\n- **Glossy \"Harness\" badge**: in dark mode the sidebar wordmar"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"k wears the official nameplate pill (135° gradient ring + soft glow); light mode keeps the stock pla"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"te\n- **Edge fades**: 5px gradient blur bands pinned to the top and bottom of the page, above the cha"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"t content — scrolling content melts into the edges; faint white veil on light, faint black on dark\n-"},{"id":"p7s13","text":" One switch: off restores the stock UI exactly, and every effect is removed with the plugin"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What this fork changes"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **DSH rc.7 compatibility (v1.4.0)**: the Plugins-section card slot became a keyed slot; the master"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"-switch card now registers with `key: 'aqua'` and the node half serves the `aqua` settings namespace"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" so the card still appears in Settings → Plugins.\n- **Unofficial rebrand**: package renamed to `dsh-"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"client-ui-aqua-unofficial` (no `@deepseek-ai` scope) and the repository name carries the `-unofficia"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"l` suffix.\n- Everything else (theme, settings, wallpapers) is unchanged from upstream v1.3.0."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Option 1: npm one-liner (recommended)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Installs the latest version from npm and registers it as a profile plugin layer (`dsh.bundle` patch)"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" — works on every platform. Reload the web UI and it is on."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> **Auto-registration**: v1.4.1+ ships the `dsh.bundle` patch inside the package, so `dsh plugin add"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"` registers the plugin layer automatically. v1.4.0 needs the `ui-aqua` row added to `cordis.patch.ym"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" the plugin layer automatically. v1.4.0 needs the `ui-aqua` row added to `cordis.patch.yml` by hand."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> **DSH rc.7**: v1.4.0+ targets `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` rc.7 (the Plugins-section card slot became a ke"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"yed slot). Earlier versions still run on rc.5/rc.6."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Option 2: GitHub installer (fallback)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"No npm account and no git needed (falls back to a plain zip download)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Windows (one command):**"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Installs the **latest release** by default. The script links the plugin into the profile's `node_mod"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ules` and registers `ui-aqua` in `cordis.patch.yml` (idempotent — safe to run again)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Pin a version or track the dev branch:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**macOS / Linux (manual, three steps):**"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"then append to `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Reload the web UI. Aqua is **on by default**; the master switch lives in **Settings → Plugins → Glas"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"s theme** (same shape as the other plugin cards), and every other control sits directly under **Sett"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ings → General → Appearance** (no title of its own): mode, blur/frost (Mica mode), fluid color, back"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ground brightness, backdrop (fluid/wallpaper) with its wallpaper controls, and the particle-whale to"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"ggle. With the master switch off, the whole control block under Appearance is hidden."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"MIT, inherited from the upstream project ((c) 2026 John Wu). See LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
